# Confluence TTP — prompt, then wait

When this session produced a product decision or idea, or changed as-built behaviour, architecture, database, API, or an engineering convention, **read and follow** `.cursor/skills/confluence-docs/SKILL.md` before calling the work done.

Prompt with the points discussed and the wiki pages they belong on. Never create or edit Confluence without the user's confirmation.
